      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip about the paper, i'll check that. but the temp readings on the IR thermometer are actually fine. the issue is more like there's a pattern to it? it's not the whole batch. it's like certain parts of the print just get \"eaten\" or lightened up randomly, even when the pressure is even. it's super frustrating because it feels like something is actively interfering with the transfer process during those few seconds of heat. is there any chemical reason why the ink wouldn't just settle where it's supposed to?",
